{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18713","headline":"龟背戏 · 柳宗元","name":"龟背戏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安新技出宫掖，喧喧初徧王侯宅。\n玉盘滴沥黄金钱，皎如文龟丽秋天。\n八方定位开神卦，六甲离离齐上下。\n投变转动玄机卑，星流霞破相参差。\n四分五裂势未已，出无入有谁能知。\n乍惊散漫无处所，须臾罗列已如故。\n徒言万事有盈虚，终朝一掷知胜负。\n修门象棋不复贵，魏宫妆奁世所弃。\n岂如瑞质耀奇文，愿持千岁寿吾君。\n庙堂巾笥非余慕，钱刀儿女徒纷纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}